		  	 <article class="obj_article_details">

		
	<h1 class="page_title">
		First record of Wroughton’s Small Spiny Mouse Mus phillipsi Wroughton, 1912 (Rodentia: Muridae) from Odisha, India with notes on diversity and distribution of other rodents
	</h1>

	
	<div class="row">
		<div class="main_entry">

							<section class="item authors">
					<h2 class="pkp_screen_reader">Authors</h2>
					<ul class="authors">
											<li>
							<span class="name">
								Pratyush P. Mohapatra
							</span>
															<span class="affiliation">
																			<span>Zoological Survey of India, Central Zone Regional Centre, Vijaynagar, Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh 482002, India.</span>
																																					</span>
																																				<span class="orcid">
																			<svg class="orcid_icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true">
	<style type="text/css">
		.st0{fill:#A6CE39;}
